{"kind":"html","caption":"用队列保存下一批待访问的节点，并在每轮开始时记录当前队列长度 levelSize。随后只弹出 levelSize 个节点，将它们组成同一层，同时把非空子节点从左到右加入队尾。这样队列中的新节点不会混入当前层，最终得到 [[3],[9,20],[15,7]]，空树则直接返回空列表。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树层序遍历演示</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ min-height:0; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 48px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #ffffff; font-size:14px; font-weight: 650; }\n  .intro { margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; color: #bdbdbd; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 24px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #404040; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 18px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .tree { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(58px, 1fr)); gap: 18px 12px; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .node-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-width: 0; }\n  .root { grid-column: 2 / 4; }\n  .left { grid-column: 1 / 3; }\n  .right { grid-column: 3 / 5; }\n  .n15 { grid-column: 3; }\n  .n7 { grid-column: 4; }\n  .node { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 52px; height: 52px; border: 2px solid #666; border-radius: 50%; background: #333; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 17px; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .node-label { min-height: 20px; color: #9d9d9d; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; }\n  .node.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .node.queued { background: #26384a; border-color: #3794ff; color: #8fc7ff; }\n  .flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; }\n  .card { min-width: 0; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #404040; border-radius: 10px; background: #252526; }\n  .card-title { margin-bottom: 14px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .queue { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; min-height: 72px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .cell { display: flex; min-width: 62px; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; padding: 9px 10px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 7px; background: #333; text-align: center; }\n  .cell .value { color: #d4d4d4; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 16px; }\n  .cell .tag { color: #9d9d9d; font-size: 13px; }\n  .cell.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.current .value { color: #fff; }\n  .empty { padding: 11px 0; color: #888; }\n  .result { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; min-height: 72px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .level { padding: 11px 13px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 7px; background: #333; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .level.latest { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .status { margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px 18px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .status strong { color: #8fc7ff; }\n  .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 22px; margin-top: 16px; color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; }\n  .dot { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-right: 7px; border: 2px solid #666; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: -1px; background: #333; }\n  .dot.active { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .dot.queued { border-color: #3794ff; background: #26384a; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) {\n    .flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .panel { padding: 16px; }\n    .tree { gap: 16px 6px; }\n    .node { width: 46px; height: 46px; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main{max-width:560px!important;padding:8px 10px 10px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.intro{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel,.card{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title,.card-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.node{width:36px!important;height:36px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-width:1px!important}.node-label{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.flow{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.cell{min-width:38px!important;padding:4px 6px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;gap:8px!important}.dot{width:8px!important;height:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>队列按层划定访问边界</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">root = [3,9,20,null,null,15,7]</span>。每轮先固定队列长度，只处理这一批节点。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">示例二叉树</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\">\n      <div class=\"node-wrap root\"><div class=\"node\" data-node=\"3\">3</div><div class=\"node-label\">第 0 层</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap left\"><div class=\"node\" data-node=\"9\">9</div><div class=\"node-label\">3 的左子节点</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap right\"><div class=\"node\" data-node=\"20\">20</div><div class=\"node-label\">3 的右子节点</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n15\"><div class=\"node\" data-node=\"15\">15</div><div class=\"node-label\">20 的左子节点</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n7\"><div class=\"node\" data-node=\"7\">7</div><div class=\"node-label\">20 的右子节点</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span><i class=\"dot active\"></i>本轮正在访问</span>\n      <span><i class=\"dot queued\"></i>已进入队列，等待后续访问</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"flow\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">队列（队首 → 队尾）</div>\n      <div id=\"queue\" class=\"queue\"></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">已完成的层</div>\n      <div id=\"result\" class=\"result\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { queue: [3], active: [], queued: [3], result: [], title: '初始化', text: '根节点非空，将 <strong>3</strong> 加入队列。' },\n    { queue: [3], active: [3], queued: [], result: [], title: '第 0 层开始', text: '记录 <span class=\"mono\">levelSize = 1</span>。本轮只弹出 1 个节点。' },\n    { queue: [9,20], active: [3], queued: [9,20], result: [[3]], title: '第 0 层完成', text: '访问 3，并按从左到右把子节点 9、20 加入队尾，得到第一层 <span class=\"mono\">[3]</span>。' },\n    { queue: [9,20], active: [9,20], queued: [], result: [[3]], title: '第 1 层开始', text: '此时 <span class=\"mono\">levelSize = 2</span>。新加入的子节点不会计入本轮。' },\n    { queue: [15,7], active: [9,20], queued: [15,7], result: [[3],[9,20]], title: '第 1 层完成', text: '依次访问 9、20；只有 20 有非空子节点，将 15、7 入队，得到 <span class=\"mono\">[9,20]</span>。' },\n    { queue: [15,7], active: [15,7], queued: [], result: [[3],[9,20]], title: '第 2 层开始', text: '记录 <span class=\"mono\">levelSize = 2</span>，访问队列中最后一层的两个节点。' },\n    { queue: [], active: [15,7], queued: [], result: [[3],[9,20],[15,7]], title: '遍历结束', text: '15、7 没有子节点，队列变空。最终结果为 <strong class=\"mono\">[[3],[9,20],[15,7]]</strong>。' }\n  ];\n  const queueEl = document.getElementById('queue');\n  const resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  const nodes = [...document.querySelectorAll('.node')];\n  let index = 0;\n\n  function render(step) {\n    nodes.forEach(node => {\n      const value = Number(node.dataset.node);\n      node.className = 'node';\n      if (step.active.includes(value)) node.classList.add('active');\n      else if (step.queued.includes(value)) node.classList.add('queued');\n    });\n\n    queueEl.innerHTML = step.queue.length\n      ? step.queue.map((value, i) => {\n          const current = step.active.includes(value) ? ' current' : '';\n          const tag = i === 0 ? '队首' : (i === step.queue.length - 1 ? '队尾' : '等待');\n          return '<div class=\"cell' + current + '\"><span class=\"value\">' + value + '</span><span class=\"tag\">' + tag + '</span></div>';\n        }).join('')\n      : '<div class=\"empty\">队列为空</div>';\n\n    resultEl.innerHTML = step.result.length\n      ? step.result.map((level, i) => '<div class=\"level' + (i === step.result.length - 1 ? ' latest' : '') + '\">[' + level.join(', ') + ']</div>').join('')\n      : '<div class=\"empty\">尚未完成任何一层</div>';\n\n    statusEl.innerHTML = '<strong>' + step.title + '</strong><br>' + step.text;\n  }\n\n  render(steps[index]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    index = (index + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[index]);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
